{"2093010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supernatural", "steam_appid": 2093010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/a27beb721af61658181f019f50a6d180.avif?t=1733831221\" width=616 height=158 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Created by a solo developer.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize your microphone to communicate with a supernatural entity.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Remember, your microphone is always listening. The louder you are, the scarier events the game will prepare for you.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 endings, each solely in your hands. Will you manage to unravel the mystery, or not? Or perhaps you'll uncover a secret ending?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>At the very end, detective Wyatt will draw his weapon to face the ultimate challenge. Will you show calm and composure to avoid death?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-repetitive logical puzzles, will you be able to demonstrate your detective intelligence?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use cameras to locate paranormal events that will aid you in unraveling the mystery.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/77ad65f470e41a670a76a78a6b43474a.poster.avif?t=1733831221\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/77ad65f470e41a670a76a78a6b43474a.webm?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/77ad65f470e41a670a76a78a6b43474a.mp4?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SINISTER CASE FOR THE FEARLESS DETECTIVE</h2></strong><br>One day, a young man writes an email to a renowned detective in the world of paranormal events, recounting the mysterious disappearance of his beloved housemaid, Mrs. Susan. She took care of the house and his pregnant fiancée while he struggled to make ends meet.<br><br>Determined to uncover the truth, detective Wyatt ventures into the unknown, determined to solve the enigma and discover what really happened to Mrs. Susan. But as he delves deeper into the investigation, he realizes that the darkness lurking within the shadows holds secrets far more terrifying than he could have ever imagined.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/669c73eb56e907afbdc1c4102f03b342.poster.avif?t=1733831221\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/669c73eb56e907afbdc1c4102f03b342.webm?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/669c73eb56e907afbdc1c4102f03b342.mp4?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTERACTIVELY SPINE-CHILLING EXPERIENCE</h2></strong><br>Experience high-quality horror that offers a plethora of intriguing solutions. Your microphone constantly picks up sounds, making each experience unique. The louder you are, the game will prepare scarier events for you. <br><br>Puzzles will test your detective and logical thinking, cameras will help you unravel the mystery of Mrs. Susan's disappearance, and communication with a supernatural entity through the microphone, which either helps you or misleads and complicates the experience. Three endings, each dependent solely on your decisions and perceptiveness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/12779991e9e6409aa3bc5e8027ce4e75.poster.avif?t=1733831221\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/12779991e9e6409aa3bc5e8027ce4e75.webm?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/12779991e9e6409aa3bc5e8027ce4e75.mp4?t=1733831221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT DOES THE SUPERNATURAL OFFER?</h2>Supernatural offers a 2-hour gameplay experience with three separate endings. It combines unique horror, high-quality execution, and unpredictability at every turn. Logical puzzles and spine-chilling story ensure that each player will encounter a different finale.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093010/extras/a27beb721af61658181f019f50a6d180.avif?t=1733831221\" width=616 height=158 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Created by a solo developer.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize your microphone to communicate with a supernatural entity.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Remember, your microphone is always listening. The louder you are, the scarier events the game will prepare for you.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 endings, each solely in your hands. Will you manage to unravel the mystery, or not? Or perhaps you'll uncover a secret ending?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>At the very end, detective Wyatt will draw his weapon to face the ultimate challenge. Will you show calm and composure to avoid death?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-repetitive logical puzzles, will you be able to demonstrate your detective intelligence?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use cameras to locate paran